      "instance_name": "amsterdam_red_light_district",
      "label": "Amsterdam Red Light District",
      "description": "A well-known area in Amsterdam, Netherlands, historically associated with prostitution and adult entertainment. The term 'red light district' refers to areas where prostitution is legal and regulated, often marked by signs like the one shown. This is a real-world location with a complex socio-economic and legal history, distinct from the false equivalence implied in the meme.",
