      "instance_name": "false_equivalence",
      "label": "False Equivalence",
      "description": "The meme creates a false equivalence by juxtaposing two vastly different contexts: Amsterdam's regulated, commercial sex industry and a fabricated 'red light district' in Islamabad. This misleading comparison is used to draw an inaccurate parallel, which can perpetuate misinformation and reinforce harmful stereotypes about both locations and the people depicted.",
