      "description": "The image of two women in traditional attire, combined with the label 'islamabad red light district', expresses a misogynistic stereotype that associates women of color with prostitution or moral degradation. This is conveyed through the juxtaposition of their appearance with the false and offensive label, implying their inherent worth or morality is tied to sexual availability or criminality.",
