      "instance_name": "mapping_amsterdam_red_light_district",
      "label": "Amsterdam red light district is mapped onto the sex shop sign",
      "description": "The text 'amsterdam red light district' is positioned directly below the visual of the 'SEX SHOP' sign, creating an analogical mapping where the sign is identified as representing the Amsterdam red light district. This mapping equates the visual material (the sign) with the textual label, implying the sign is a symbol or representative of the district.",
