      "label": "Islamabad red light district is mapped onto the two women in traditional attire",
      "description": "The text 'islamabad red light district' is positioned directly below the image of two women in traditional attire, creating an analogical mapping where the women are identified as representing the Islamabad red light district. This mapping equates the visual material (the women) with the textual label, implying they are part of or symbolize the district, which is a false and harmful equivalence.",
